      "dcterms:title": "DERIVED HECKE ALGEBRA AND COHOMOLOGY OF ARITHMETIC GROUPS AKSHAY VENKA TESH",
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20190130",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1608.07234",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We describe a graded extension of the usual Hecke algebra: i t acts in a graded fashion on the cohomology of an arithmetic group Γ . Under favorable conditions, the cohomology is freely generated in a single degree over this g raded Hecke algebra. From this construction we extract an action of certainp-adic Galois cohomology groups on H ˚ pΓ , Qpq, and formulate the central conjecture: the motivic Q-lattice inside these Galois cohomology groups preserves H ˚ pΓ , Qq.",
